{"strings": [
  {"text":"AFT · HOLD 1","translation":"선미 · 1번 화물칸","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/aft_bulkhead.js"},
  {"text":"SEALED","translation":"봉인됨","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/aft_bulkhead.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2","translation":"2번 에어록","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"LOCKED","translation":"잠김","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"STUCK","translation":"끼임","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"PARTLY OPEN","translation":"일부 열림","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"OPEN","translation":"열림","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"MANUAL DRIVE","translation":"수동 구동","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/airlock.js"},
  {"text":"SUIT 02 · CH. 2","translation":"우주복 02 · 채널 2","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/intercom.js"},
  {"text":"COMMS","translation":"통신","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/intercom.js"},
  {"text":"JAMMED","translation":"고착","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AJAR","translation":"살짝 열림","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"LIDA · CORRIDOR 2-4","translation":"리다 · 복도 2-4","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2: {state}","translation":"2번 에어록: {state}","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CREW ON BOARD: 3/3","translation":"탑승 승무원: 3/3","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CH. 2: VOICE","translation":"채널 2: 음성","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"CH. 2: NOISE","translation":"채널 2: 잡음","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/lida.js"},
  {"text":"AIRLOCK 2  →","translation":"2번 에어록  →","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"DECK 2 · SECT. 4","translation":"2갑판 · 4구역","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"CHECK PRESSURE BEFORE EXIT","translation":"나가기 전 기압 확인","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_left.js"},
  {"text":"←  AIRLOCK 2","translation":"←  2번 에어록","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"OBSERVATION BAY · 4","translation":"관측실 · 4","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"O₂ · EMERG. MASKS","translation":"O₂ · 비상 마스크","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/elements/wall_right.js"},
  {"text":"Corridor by the Observation Bay","translation":"관측실 옆 복도","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"The Ladoga, deck 2. Emergency lighting, frost on the gratings, the airlock jammed.","translation":"라도가호, 2갑판. 비상등, 격자 위의 성에, 꽉 끼어 버린 에어록.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"The doors of airlock 2 have opened all the way. Cold drifts out of the chamber, vapour creeps across the floor.","translation":"2번 에어록의 문짝이 끝까지 열렸다. 안에서 냉기가 흘러나오고, 김이 바닥을 타고 깔린다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"The doors of airlock 2 have parted a hand's width and stuck.","translation":"2번 에어록의 문짝이 손바닥 너비만큼 벌어지더니 멈춰 버렸다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Airlock 2 has closed and locked.","translation":"2번 에어록이 닫히고 잠겼다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has reached the airlock and taken hold of the manual drive's handle.","translation":"베라가 에어록에 다다라 수동 구동 손잡이를 붙잡았다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has stopped at a porthole; beyond the glass, the red disc of the dwarf.","translation":"베라가 현창 앞에 멈춰 섰다. 유리 너머로 왜성의 붉은 원반이 보인다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has gone back to the observation bay hatch.","translation":"베라가 관측실 해치로 돌아갔다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Vera has disappeared into the airlock.","translation":"베라가 에어록 안으로 사라졌다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"A trail of frost footprints from the airlock has reached the observation bay hatch.","translation":"에어록에서 이어진 성에 발자국이 관측실 해치까지 닿았다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"Ten percent of the oxygen is left in the corridor.","translation":"복도에 산소가 10퍼센트 남았다.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"},
  {"text":"The speaker by the airlock has come alive: hiss on the channel of suit 2, as if someone is holding down the talk button.","translation":"에어록 옆 스피커가 살아났다. 우주복 2번 채널에서 치직거리는 소리. 누군가 송신 버튼을 누르고 있는 것처럼.","where":"worlds/knock-on-the-porthole/scenes/observation-corridor/script.js"}
]}
